[en.FOCUS_C02_APPLE_SOUTHERN_FRIEND]
New Friends in the South

[en.FOCUS_C02_APPLE_SOUTHERN_FRIEND_desc]
We need to respond to the aggressive attitude of Appleloosa, but Trixie has promised peace and stability to the residents of Ponyville.\nSo we need some new friends to help us — like the Buffalo Tribe in the South, who is said to have had some conflicts with Appleloosa.

[zh.FOCUS_C02_APPLE_SOUTHERN_FRIEND]
南方的新朋友

[zh.FOCUS_C02_APPLE_SOUTHERN_FRIEND_desc]
我们需要对态度嚣张的苹果鲁萨做出一些回应... 但特丽克西向小马谷的居民承诺了和平与稳定。\n所以我们需要一些新的朋友来帮助我们——比如南方的野牛部落，据说他们曾经和苹果鲁萨有些矛盾。

